{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e0f7e9a4c7f86a16a32d9cb5a86e49779e6a81f907be85fa58898b2018aca835", "ja": "（今回の衣装は、琴葉から意見をもらって調整をしたり\n手の込んだ一着になった。仕上がりはどうかな？）", "zh": "（这次的服装参考了琴叶的意见进行调整，做成了一件很花心思的衣服。成品效果怎么样？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "cd6f56e2ee4430890fe167bba75231a5ef86672dd848e142d9021fb6a59bb2d6", "ja": "{$P$}。今回も、私の意見を\n色々取り入れてくださって、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "{$P$}。这次也非常感谢您采纳了我的各种意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a4b47bcc8ca1955c33e744eb1a79c56a831f700a5d355ad8973a2e2c23388bf8", "ja": "こちらこそ。\n琴葉が積極的に意見をくれて助かったよ。", "zh": "我才要谢谢你。琴叶积极地提出了很多意见，帮了我大忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "b794f79ba7b62ddddb2dd78e1f0482e43351a5e0d13b4553e64b5006838b194f", "ja": "そうですね。今回は、新曲のお披露目公演で着る衣装、\nというのもあったので……。", "zh": "是啊。这次毕竟还是新歌首演时要穿的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "b39f00faa8d9627d5b29abb2b13bfff01fa2bf837942831dad7577c54354bdd2", "ja": "責任を持ちたかった……というのが、\n大きいかもしれません。", "zh": "想要负起责任……这一点，或许才是最重要的原因。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1005_p", "source_sha256": "793de1d14dbefdfbcb32aed08b9d663f503e1268cf36827d0e2edfbf0d1140c8", "ja": "責任？", "zh": "责任？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "76dc6854fa501c6c019c0a99b425cf8782b3d7dd4a78746c7c5fba096d73024a", "ja": "はい。あっ！　もちろん、普段の公演も\n責任感を持って取り組んでいるつもりですけど。", "zh": "是的。啊！当然，平时的公演我也自认为是抱着责任感认真对待的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "1baf6d0ce71537e0235d7531b11e98f0120cd6b4bc80ddc6f20dd8b521c4cde9", "ja": "ただ、これは私だけの衣装だって考えたら……\nすごく、責任を感じたんです。", "zh": "不过，一想到这件衣服是只属于我的……\n就让我感到肩上的责任非常重大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "9e6086e0f088b06896d2107017c497acda4459df374c5993b0ddb430cfdb9193", "ja": "いつもなら、{$P$}や、\n美咲さんに相談に乗ってもらったり……。", "zh": "换作平时，我都会找{$P$}，\n或是找美咲小姐商量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "b07a36709802fe7ae20361f221ff2ceb86723e09212a52a40d9aec28a67f0e10", "ja": "みんなの意見をたくさん聞いて。それで、\n『正解』を探していた気がするんです。", "zh": "听取大家的各种意见，然后去寻找\n那个所谓的“正确答案”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "1453b3c8ae192bdd66619423d2978d9fb3eebf703cebbb8e716e130d861df6f2", "ja": "今でも、違う意見を聞くと「その方がいいかも」って\n揺らいだりしますけど……。", "zh": "即使是现在，听到不同的意见时，我也还是会动摇，觉得“那样或许更好”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "7c543bc032f9850371820a45020ad023638b954b2573f7316e1216726845b7c9", "ja": "でも今回は……私が決めよう、って思ったんです。\n最後まで責任を持って、自分で選ぼうって。", "zh": "不过这一次……我想由自己来做决定。\n要负起责任坚持到最后，自己做出选择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1013_p", "source_sha256": "859826cbfa830456521849ce40ab2f6d205569c8ecc986651a858762470c8661", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nいいと思うよ、そういう琴葉も。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n我觉得那样的琴叶也很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "f9b14b61b0cee4c708467937d531b18d5a26cc5409ae765cdbb86c227a68b383", "ja": "ありがとうございます。この素敵な衣装に\n相応しいステージを披露しないと！", "zh": "谢谢。一定要献上与这身华丽服装相称的舞台才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1015_p", "source_sha256": "bdd99762a286a8d8fc6cf5b2d193f2c020f3e1d0fc666459e59926d2967308de", "ja": "そうだな。最高のステージになるよう、\n俺も全力で琴葉をサポートするよ。", "zh": "是啊。为了打造最棒的舞台，我也会全力支持琴叶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "169b63a3adeac222068bb591b181a1016ff96e9df41fe24edf2bc82e24547fba", "ja": "はい。あとは、ファンの人達に\n喜んでもらえるかどうか、ですね。", "zh": "是的。接下来就要看能不能让粉丝们开心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "24b1142611d9e6da61b3478ee7dcffb8dd4b3c5fbe0944fb1ca5a37c66c3b94a", "ja": "正直、緊張しますけど……\nでもそれ以上に、本番が楽しみなんです。", "zh": "说实话，我很紧张……\n但比起紧张，我更期待正式演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2192809fb4a5665cf17706a9178dde22e8394442aa84527d0c8fb465bbb277b5", "ja": "それは良かった。\n……そうだ、ステージ演出はどうだ？", "zh": "那就好。\n……对了，舞台演出怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1019_p", "source_sha256": "66af7ffb1ee3a4afda3f08c4e583b485323d659ada7a5e91f25d121160a3c205", "ja": "もしやってみたい事があるなら、意見を聞きたいな。\nまだ調整できるから。", "zh": "如果你有什么想尝试的事情，我想听听你的意见。\n现在还可以调整。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "dc4e2ebd9f53574bf323d98c477bcb1ea11a51183590aac884ed5cf11215f1af", "ja": "えっ、いいんですか？\nだったら私、やってみたいことがあって……！", "zh": "诶，可以吗？\n那样的话，我有一件想尝试的事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0614_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c03ebbd2d190843b665736ae68eac4cad334c945cea53f70cf09bd39765ea90e", "ja": "（その後、琴葉から色々な意見を聞いた。\nやりたい事が、少しでも形にできるといいな）", "zh": "（之后，我听取了琴叶的各种意见。希望她想做的事，哪怕只有一点，也能实现……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
